level_effect.desc:
All Brilliant Blessing base effects are enhanced: 
For Electro Crystal Blessings, characters' <color=#f39001>Electro and Geo</color> DMG Bonus increase is increased by <color=#f39001>10%</color>;
For Electro-Charged Blessings, the increase in DMG dealt by <color=#f39001>Electro-Charged reactions</color> triggered by party members is increased by <color=#f39001>50%</color>, while the increase in DMG dealt by party members' <color=#f39001>Lunar-Charged</color> reactions is increased by <color=#f39001>15%</color>;
For Hydro Crystal Blessings, characters' <color=#f39001>Hydro and Geo</color> DMG Bonus increase is increased by <color=#f39001>10%</color>, and DMG increase dealt with the <color=#f39001>Lunar-Crystallize reaction</color> is increased by <color=#f39001>15%</color>.
